      "id": "p1",
      "text": "The director orchestrating the mythic love story chose an actress to embody the most iconic love and betrayal figures in Western myth. This casting decision, a cultural event in film production activity, sparked a brutal betrayal of the creative love vision in public discourse. Advocates for shared beauty and inclusive love stories spoke for a more beautiful, interconnected vision of love's legacy against the allegations of historical erasure. Now, a love story has become a battleground for who may be loved and remembered, revealing a deep ideological conflict over the soul of these shared narratives.",
